# with a Lightning Bolt (an artifact and a creature). Turn 3: Bot1 draws three cards (two at the upkeep) and Bot2 two, and Bot1
# casts Chain Lightning (a sorcery): three types. Bot2, with eight cards at its turn 4 cleanup, discards one down to seven.

